1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,950
…Mr. Cole?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,172
Is my name on this?

3
00:00:05,222 --> 00:00:06,950
I didn't sign it.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,172
That's not what I asked.

5
00:00:09,222 --> 00:00:10,950
<i>Don't cry. Not here.</i>

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,950
<i>Five o'clock. Unsigned.</i>

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,950
You want me to hate him? I'm really
good at it.

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,617
I don't know what I want.

9
00:00:20,667 --> 00:00:21,950
<i>Yes I do.</i>

10
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,950
<i>Ugh. She put it back.</i>

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,950
Deadline passed. And Grant knows about
Abby. He's telling the board you're
compromised.

12
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,258
Good. Tell him it's not signed.

13
00:00:33,308 --> 00:00:35,181
He'll go to the board.

14
00:00:35,231 --> 00:00:35,950
Let him.

15
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,950
<i>Jo?</i>

16
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,950
<i>Nonrefundable. That's the only reason
I'm here.</i>

17
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,236
Waiting on someone?

18
00:00:42,286 --> 00:00:43,950
No. I mean— no.

19
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,950
<i>Of course he's soaked. Of course.</i>

20
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,450
Last one on the list.

21
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,950
You kept it?

22
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,950
I'm Hunter Cole. I started Lumen at
nineteen. Ten years later, I knew
nobody in my building.

23
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,950
Two hundred jobs. Yours first. I came
down to meet who I was firing.

24
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,950
<i>I wasn't the date. I was the research.</i>

25
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:15,950
Then you rolled your chair into mine.
Ten years rich, and I'd never done one
thing. Until the axe.

26
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,950
You lied to me. For weeks. You know
who else did that?

27
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,283
…Your dad.

28
00:01:22,333 --> 00:01:22,950
Yeah.

29
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,950
You twist your watch when you lie. I
counted three.

30
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,950
…It's more than three.

31
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:29,950
I know.

32
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,950
<i>No more.</i>

33
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,236
And my team—

34
00:01:33,286 --> 00:01:34,950
I'm not signing it.

35
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,950
Because of me?

36
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,950
Because you were right. I'm a project.

37
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,236
That's so annoying.

38
00:01:41,286 --> 00:01:42,950
<i>Don't smile. Too late.</i>

39
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,150
It's hideous.

40
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,950
It's so hideous.

41
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,950
I don't know if I can trust you yet.

42
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,950
Okay. What would it take?

43
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,150
<i>Photos. Of us.</i>

44
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:58,950
Then prove it. Monday. All-hands.
Camera on.
